37-59fb-85ec-1a2785aa394a" 13194139538679 17592186045443 true] [17592186671866 1074 "To find the general solution, we first separate the variables:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}y′ & =- \\frac{4 x}{3 y^{2}} \\\\ 3 y^{2}\\,\\frac{\\mathrm{d}y}{\\mathrm{d}x} & =- 4 x\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThen, we integrate both sides with respect to $x:$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\int 3 y^{2}\\,\\mathrm{d}y & =\\int - 4 x\\,\\mathrm{d}x \\\\ y^{3} & =- 2 x^{2}+C\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the general solution in implicit form is\n\n$$\ny^{3}=- 2 x^{2}+C.\n$$\n\nWe're required to write the solution in the form $y=y(x).$ Solving for $y$ gives\n\n$$\ny=\\sqrt[3]{C - 2 x^{2}}.\n$$\n\nHere $C$ is an arbitrary real constant." 13194139538679 17592186045443 true] [17592186671867 1080 "y=\\ln{\\left(C - \\left(x - 8\\right)^{2} \\right)}" 13194139538679 17592186045443 true] [17592186671867 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045498 13194139538679 17592186045443 true] [17592186671867 1083 #uuid "b00f57f9-5b2b-5444-9f23-46a31d7ebdbb" 13194139538679 17592186045443 true] [17592186671868 1080 "y=\\left(C + 2 \\left(x + 7\\right)^{2}\\right)^{3}" 13194139538679 17592186045443 true] [17592186671868 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045498 13194139538679 17592186045443 true] [17592186671868 1083 #uuid "ba88b057-eed7-5cc6-bd3a-e13e9089e059" 13194139538679 17592186045443 true] [17592186671869 1075 #edb/ref 17592186671839 13194139538679 17592186045443 true] [17592186671869 1075 #edb/ref 17592186671851 13194139538679 17592186045443 true] [17592186671869 1075 #edb/ref 17592186671854 13194139538679 17592186045443 true] [17592186671869 1075 #edb/ref 17592186671861 13194139538679 17592186045443 true] [17592186671869 1075 #edb/ref 17592186671862 13194139538679 17592186045443 true] [17592186671869 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045493 13194139538679 17592186045443 true] [17592186671869 1077 "selection" 13194139538679 17592186045443 true] [17592186671869 1078 #edb/ref 17592186671854 13194139538679 17592186045443 true] [17592186671869 1079 #uuid "bb03